# Mid-Autumn Festival update
msgid "Mid-Autumn mooncake gift box"
msgstr "中秋月饼礼盒"

# Mid-Autumn Festival update
msgid "Mid-Autumn mooncake gift boxes"
msgstr "中秋月饼礼盒"

# Mid-Autumn Festival update
msgid "May we live long and share the beauty of the moon together, even if we are a thousand miles apart."
msgstr "但愿人长久，千里共婵娟。"

# Mid-Autumn Festival update
msgid "Mid-Autumn mooncake recipes"
msgstr "中秋月饼配方"

# Mid-Autumn Festival update
msgid "copies of Mid-Autumn mooncake recipes"
msgstr "中秋月饼配方"

# Mid-Autumn Festival update
msgid "A small festive recipe booklet covering several common mooncakes and a floral pastry filling."
msgstr "一本小巧的中秋节配方册，记录了几种常见月饼和鲜花饼馅的做法。"

# Mid-Autumn Festival update
msgid "lotus seed and salted egg yolk mooncake"
msgstr "莲蓉蛋黄月饼"

# Mid-Autumn Festival update
msgid "A dense baked mooncake filled with sweet lotus seed paste and a rich salted egg yolk."
msgstr "传统烘烤月饼，内馅是香甜的莲蓉和浓郁的咸蛋黄。"

# Mid-Autumn Festival update
msgid "red bean mooncake"
msgstr "豆沙月饼"

# Mid-Autumn Festival update
msgid "A baked mooncake with a smooth, sweet red bean filling."
msgstr "传统烘烤月饼，里面包着细腻香甜的豆沙馅。"

# Mid-Autumn Festival update
msgid "five-nut mooncake"
msgstr "五仁月饼"

# Mid-Autumn Festival update
msgid "A traditional baked mooncake packed with a sweet, chewy mixture of nuts and seeds."
msgstr "传统烘烤月饼，里面是由多种坚果和种子组成的香甜耐嚼馅料。"

# Mid-Autumn Festival update
msgid "snow-skin mooncake"
msgstr "冰皮月饼"

# Mid-Autumn Festival update
msgid "A soft, chilled mooncake with a pale, slightly chewy skin and a sweet filling.  It does not keep nearly as well as a baked mooncake."
msgstr "柔软冰凉的月饼，浅色外皮略带弹性，里面包着甜馅。它远没有烘烤月饼那么耐放。"

# Mid-Autumn Festival update
msgid "Dali flower-pastry filling"
msgstr "大理鲜花饼馅"

# Mid-Autumn Festival update
msgid "A fragrant, sugary floral filling inspired by the rose fillings used in Dali-style flower pastries."
msgstr "香甜而带着花香的馅料，做法取自大理鲜花饼常见的玫瑰花馅。"

# Mid-Autumn Festival update
msgid "A Mid-Autumn Festival recipe booklet and mooncake gift box have been delivered to you."
msgstr "你收到了一份中秋月饼配方和一个月饼礼盒。"
